  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "The short answer",
      "items": [
        "It embeds the ticket, retrieves published knowledge-base articles, asks the model to answer only from them, scores confidence, records the evidence on the audit chain, and then acts: auto-resolve at 0.78 or more, draft at 0.55 or more, otherwise escalate",
        "P1 and workflow tickets never auto-resolve"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Not shown here",
      "items": [
        "The persisted resolution with its citations",
        "The fallback path is also not drawn: with no provider configured, an offline template and hashed embeddings are used and the same steps run",
        "Connected but out of scope: Auth.js sessions, Context and guards, API key service, REST API /api/v1, Inbound webhook routes, Channel adapters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Doctrine",
      "items": [
        "AI confidence of 0.78 or more auto-resolves, 0.55 or more drafts for an agent, anything lower escalates; critical (P1) tickets never auto-resolve: thresholds are environment-tunable and the P1 guardrail keeps a person in the loop",
        "A ticket inside the bucket workflow is never auto-resolved by AI and is skipped by the legacy SLA sweep: the workflow requires human resolution and has its own monitor; the AI only drafts a suggestion"
      ]
    }
  ]
